**Chapter 1 (EDA)** has the natural home for an explicit statement. The "Discussion: what should EDA mean?" section already contrasts EDA with confirmatory analysis and emphasizes "understanding current and potential data sets." But it stops short of the fuller claim you want to make—that understanding isn't an alternative to practical skill but its foundation.

